  "id": "tomorrow_together",
  "name": "Tomorrow, Together",
  "desc": "A grand gift swoops down into the livestream.\n\"It's a specially customized third anniversary cake from the fans for everyone!\"\n\nEvery cherished memory becomes a driving force in this moment, pulling everyone together toward the future.\n\"May everyone move forward happily and safely in the new year!\"\n\"Don't worry, conductor! March Bunny will capture this moment~\"\n\nIn the heartwarming atmosphere, everyone raises their glasses together, laughter and joy filling every corner.\n\"On this day worth celebrating, let us raise our glasses.\"\n\"To the star-filled tomorrow—\"\n\"Cheers!\"",
